window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>An unbreakable bond. A woman on the edge. A war between light and darkness.</p> <p>Now that Ophelia is Light, First and Eldest of the Highest, she knows the darkness is inevitable. Even with the strength and support of the Oneiroi, Ophelia can not hide from the Younger, or the horde of Earth Demons at their command. After all, humanity will fall if the Earth Demons escape their mountain prison…</p> <p>Can Ophelia fight against the forces that wish to dismantle her? Or will darkness prevail and put out the light for good?</p>"; 
